## indirectseam_mirror_none.rib's scene, naming constantindirect: the
## mirror's reflection brightens by exactly that module's constant, proof
## the pass reaches a reflected hit's shading, not only a primary one. Not
## third-party.
Display "indirectseam_mirror_constant.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 48 48 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Option "render" "string indirect" ["constantindirect"]
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.3931372549019608]

AttributeBegin
Identity
Translate 0 0 -10
Surface "matte" "Ka" [1] "Kd" [1]
Color [1 1 1]
Opacity [1 1 1]
Sides 2
Sphere 5 -5 5 360
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
Surface "mirror" "Kr" [1]
Color [1 1 1]
Opacity [1 1 1]
Sphere 1.2 -1.2 1.2 360
AttributeEnd

WorldEnd
